<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Viacom Inc raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Viacom Inc raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it upgraded Viacom Inc to buy from accumulate and set a $41 price target on the stock.</p>
<p>-- said there is significant value at the current price level, assuming double-digit EBITDA growth in fiscal 1997 and significant debt repayment over the next 24-36 months.</p>
<p>-- Viacom was up 7/8 to 34 at midday.</p>
</text>
